{"id": "DfXozODA0uD", "title": "Video by kathayug27", "description": "Why Ravana Could Never Force Sita\n\nThe night before the war, Ravana confessed a secret to his own minister. 😳\n\n\"Just take her by force,\" Mahaparshva said. Ravana's answer: Brahma had cursed him. If he ever forced a woman, his head would burst into a hundred pieces.\n\nNot respect. Not dharma. Fear. Did you know this was in Valmiki's Ramayana? 👇\nFull story on YouTube: KathaYug (link in bio) 🔗\n\n#ramayana #valmikiramayana #ravana #sita #brahma #jaishreeram #hindumythology #indianmythology #sanatandharma #mythology #animation #reels #reelsinstagram #kathayug\n\n© KathaYug. Original animation. Do not re-upload.", "channel": "kathayug27", "uploader_id": "80321060615", "uploader": "KathaYug", "timestamp": 1793902088, "like_count": 3, "comment_count": 0, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-995473823604178a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 65.97, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQO1_YyCb9zfP4FXPoQKjsrqEnmLsL90yWn6cPhl4UZTXYWNkA5_KcQgv35K1oFDJmVFQutP1Eg2kyz87Dq8jGt6SJxPne_5YacYjHs.mp4?_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=AdrdLAkGZ7wpNyvUkN8ZX6Iyz7-RWwX3FN5FfH1ReXZqwOwyqzZXjjg3hqU_f_YpVyawO2YwwdUZePA_4rROiWUP&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=EzeQT_osZ6oQ7kNvwFWPI7f&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=r11-QdhwnqhVXLeQZHPy_Q&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQS0mAxqFBVF0kfKuD0DHyPHQF63kMq7PHrVTB5pYOQ8rw&oe=6AF424DA", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "